  "description": "AWS SDK for .NET V3 reached end of support on June 1st, 2026, and no longer receives updates, including security fixes. See https://docs.aws.amazon.com/sdk-for-net/v4/developer-guide/net-dg-v4.html for migration guidance. With code signing for IoT, you can sign code that you create for any IoT device that is supported by Amazon Web Services (AWS). Code signing is available through Amazon FreeRTOS and AWS IoT Device Management, and integrated with AWS Certificate Manager (ACM).",
